%% Context: Consumer lending workflow with automated decisioning and manual review.
flowchart TD
  A([Application submitted]) --> B[Verify identity]
  B --> C{Identity verified?}
  C -->|No| D([Decline application])
  C -->|Yes| E[(Run credit check)]
  E --> F{Credit score meets policy?}
  F -->|Yes| G{Debt-to-income within limit?}
  F -->|Borderline| H[[Manual underwriting review]]
  F -->|No| D
  G -->|Yes| I[Generate loan offer]
  G -->|No| H
  H --> J{Request more evidence?}
  J -->|Yes| K[Collect supporting documents]
  K -.-> H
  J -->|No| L{Approved by underwriter?}
  L -->|Yes| I
  L -->|No| D
  I --> M([Offer issued])
